version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-16
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/milatechtransfer/heams"
url: "https://milatechtransfer.github.io/heams/"
abstract: >-
  HEAMS is an open framework for evaluating memory systems for AI agents. It
  measures both what memory adds to an agent (recalling, updating, and reusing
  information over long interactions) and what it risks for the user (leaking,
  keeping, or failing to forget personal information). Agents, memory systems,
  and benchmarks are declared in YAML, and memory systems plug in as separate
  packages.
keywords:
  - agent memory
  - memory systems
  - benchmark
  - evaluation
  - LLM agents
  - privacy
